[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0010","text":"──有东西掉了……？\n这个……还是送到前台比较好吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0020","text":"戒指啊……\n我去送吧，日花你先走"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0030","text":"啊，好的……\n麻烦您了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0040","text":"（好漂亮啊，那枚戒指……\n　那个，应该是……铂金的────）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0050","text":"（戒指什么的，嘛，也挺好的\n　但是，一定……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0052","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0060","text":"早上好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0070","text":"啊，您早上好……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0072","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0080","text":"……嗯？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0090","text":"啊……没有────没什么……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_03_0100","text":"（舞台上的，绝对更……\n　更美，更耀眼────）"}]
